data: {"id": "32c6451dedc640e4-final", "run_id": "32c6451dedc640e4", "seq": 2119, "ts_ms": 1788413470277, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... Error: ImagePullBackOff` (fact-0e5b1ba23ea0) | 确认容器等待状态为镜像拉取失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/...\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-f7d2b5761a29) | 确认直接原因为 DNS 解析失败，镜像仓库域名无效 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.waiting_message: `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (fact-3d1b8e20d635) | 确认具体拉取失败的镜像及 Back-off 状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{...reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"} = 1` (fact-3f67c0528b19) | 通过指标确认当前 Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n证据 1、2、3 均来源于 K8s 事件和状态，且相互印证：Kubelet 尝试拉取 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，因 `registry.invalid` 无法解析（no such host）而失败，随后进入 Back-off 状态。指标事实 4 与 K8s 状态事实一致，确认了该现象在监控时间点的持续性。由于容器未启动，日志和链路追踪数据不可用（工具执行失败且容器状态不支持）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 镜像配置了无效域名 registry.invalid → DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败 → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 的容器配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`。\n- **事实支撑**：K8s Event 明确指出 `failed to do request... lookup registry.invalid... no such host` (证据 #2)，且 `kubelet` 报告 `Error: ImagePullBackOff` (证据 #1)。\n- **现象解释**：由于无法解析镜像仓库地址，容器无法下载镜像，导致 Pod 处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（证据 #3、#4），用户可见服务不可用。\n- **缺失环节**：无。根因直接由 K8s 事件中的 DNS 解析失败记录证实，无需进一步日志或指标推断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 58.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4: 58.6s (Evidence 49.4s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 86.357, "metrics": {"run_id": "32c6451dedc640e4", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 86.36413311958313, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 86364.13311958313, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 82175.48704147339, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 7472.832441329956, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3764.0299797058105}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18082.889795303345, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 58612.49017715454, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9644.468307495117, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

